X05A01 ~y~Karim (radio):~w~ More on the ridge! They are coming down both sides, and a pickup is on your tail!
X05A02 ~r~Clear the attackers before unloading the truck!
X05A03 ~g~The villagers unload the truck while the road is watched. Hold position.
X05A04 ~r~Karim and Jawed did not make it to the village.
